OL,3,GNEWSACrime commissioner opposes 'mega
OL,4,Aforce' merger
OL,5,
OL,6,FSuffolk's police and crime commissioner
OL,7,Fhas reaffirmed his opposition to any
OL,8,F"mega force" or large regional force to
OL,9,Freplace the county's constabulary.
OL,11,FTim Passmore said the idea of Suffolk
OL,12,Fmerging with forces in Bedfordshire,
OL,13,FCambridgeshire, Essex, Hertfordshire
OL,14,Fand Norfolk would not be in the
OL,15,Finterests of the largely rural county.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,380,370,200,160,0,100
