OL,1,W5j 5Qws js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSACrime commissioner opposes 'mega
OL,4,Aforce' merger
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said he was "deeply concerned that
OL,7,Four community policing in remote rural
OL,8,Fareas like we have here in Suffolk and,
OL,9,Fto be fair, in Norfolk will actually be
OL,10,Fannihilated, and all the money, all the
OL,11,Fresource will flow to areas on the
OL,12,FLondon fringe and large urban areas".
OL,14,FThe Home Office has been asked to
OL,15,Fcomment on its future plans and review
OL,16,Fof police forces.
